<main class="about-main">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="about-hero">
        <h1>Artender</h1>
        <p>
            Artender is a creative ecosystem built to celebrate artists, showcase originality,
            and connect art lovers with authentic talent across India.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Vision / Mission / Goal -->
    <div class="aboutus-container">
        <div class="aboutus-card">
            <h2>Our Vision</h2>
            <p>
                To create India’s most inspiring digital space where artists of every age and background
                can confidently present their work, gain recognition, and grow through meaningful opportunities.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="aboutus-card">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>
                We conduct engaging competitions, curated exhibitions, and creative challenges that
                encourage artistic expression while providing real exposure and credibility to creators.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="aboutus-card">
            <h2>Our Goal</h2>
            <p>
                To become a trusted bridge between artists and audiences by enabling discovery,
                appreciation, and opportunities in the evolving art landscape.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Story Section -->
    <section class="about-story">
        <h2>The Story Behind Artender</h2>
        <p>
            Artender was born from a simple idea — many talented artists lack a stage to present their work.
            Traditional galleries are limited, competitions are inaccessible, and recognition often depends
            on networks rather than talent. Artender changes that.
        </p>
        <p>
            We created a platform where creativity speaks louder than connections. A place where
            artists can participate, exhibit, compete, and grow in a supportive digital environment.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- What We Offer -->
    <section class="about-features">
        <h2>What Artender Offers</h2>

        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-item">
                <h3> Online Art Competitions</h3>
                <p>Participate in themed competitions judged fairly to gain recognition and awards.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-item">
                <h3> Artist Showcases</h3>
                <p>Display your artwork to a growing audience that appreciates original creativity.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-item">
                <h3> Community of Creators</h3>
                <p>Connect with fellow artists, share ideas, and be part of a supportive creative network.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-item">
                <h3> Recognition & Growth</h3>
                <p>Earn certificates, visibility, and credibility that help you progress in your art journey.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing Section -->
    <section class="about-closing">
        <h2>For Artists. By People Who Value Art.</h2>
        <p>
            Artender is not just a platform — it is a movement to uplift creativity,
            encourage participation, and celebrate the true spirit of art across the country.
        </p>
    </section>

</main>

<style>
  /* ===== About Page — Clean Artender Theme ===== */

.about-main{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:60px auto;
    padding:0 20px 60px;
    font-family:'Noto Sans', sans-serif;
}

/* Hero */
.about-hero{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:50px;
}

.about-hero h1{
    font-size:42px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#1f2937;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.about-hero p{
    font-size:18px;
    color:#6b7280;
}

/* Cards Container */
.aboutus-container{
    display:flex;
    gap:28px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

/* Artender Cards */
.aboutus-card{
    background:#ffffff;
    width:320px;
    padding:32px 26px;
    border-radius:20px;
    border:1px solid #ffedd5;
    box-shadow:0 12px 45px rgba(249,115,22,0.12);
    transition:all .35s ease;
    text-align:center;
}

.aboutus-card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(249,115,22,0.25);
}

/* Titles */
.aboutus-card h2{
    font-size:22px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#f97316;
    margin-bottom:14px;
}

/* Text */
.aboutus-card p{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:#374151;
}
    /* ===== Additional About Sections ===== */

.about-story,
.about-features,
.about-closing{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:70px auto 0;
    text-align:center;
}

.about-story h2,
.about-features h2,
.about-closing h2{
    font-size:28px;
    color:#1f2937;
    margin-bottom:18px;
}

.about-story p,
.about-closing p{
    color:#4b5563;
    line-height:1.8;
    font-size:16px;
    margin-bottom:14px;
}

/* Features Grid */
.features-grid{
    display:flex;
    gap:24px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-top:30px;
}

.feature-item{
    width:240px;
    background:#fff7ed;
    border:1px solid #fed7aa;
    padding:22px 18px;
    border-radius:16px;
    transition:all .3s ease;
}

.feature-item:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(249,115,22,0.18);
}

.feature-item h3{
    font-size:18px;
    color:#ea580c;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.feature-item p{
    font-size:14px;
    color:#374151;
    line-height:1.6;
}

@media(max-width:768px){
    .feature-item{
        width:100%;
    }
}


/* Responsive */
@media (max-width:768px){
    .about-hero h1{
        font-size:30px;
    }
    .aboutus-card{
        width:100%;
    }
}
</style>
